a03: OIDC provider authenticates user { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a04: App auth adapter resolves local identity { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a05: Load organization · customer · user · role { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a06: After Begin Visit and preflight, create session · POST /api/sessions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a07: Check tenant ownership and role { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a08: Deny cross-tenant request without state disclosure { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a09: Load model · audio · exam · order entitlements { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a10: Check per-user and per-session quota { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a11: Return bounded quota response { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a12: Create one opaque app sessionId { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a13: Bind session to customer · tenant · user { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a14: Rotate HTTP-only · Secure · SameSite cookie { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a15: On each request authenticate cookie or authorized socket ticket { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a16: Recheck session owner · tenant · role · entitlement { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a17: Browser never sends API key · model ID · provider context ID { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
a01 -> a02 -> a03 -> a04 -> a05

// Signed-in home destinations and encounter preflight.
i01: Show the signed-in home page after authentication { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
