// Idempotent setup lane and immutable synthetic-patient seed creation.
s01: POST /api/sessions/:sessionId/setup { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s02: Authenticate · authorize owner · check setup entitlement { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s03: Check setup idempotency key { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s04: Return previously committed seed and setup result { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s05: Enqueue within bounded setup capacity { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s06: Enforce setup concurrency · queue · timeout · retry budget { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s07: Return pending / overload response without partial activation { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s08: Load versioned prompt · schema · rubric · model config { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s09: Create random scenario seed once; reuse it on retry { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s10: Build strict PatientScenarioSeed structured-output request { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s11: Generate identity · symptoms · onset · relevant negatives { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s12: Generate history cues · medications · allergies · patient concerns { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s13: Generate clinician-hidden diagnosis or explicitly unknown status { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s14: Generate fixed exam findings · supported test/result catalog { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s15: Generate fixed bounded personality traits and persona seed { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s16: Attach educator-reviewed rubric and version references { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s17: Call Responses API for structured setup output inside the session Conversation { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s18: Validate strict versioned JSON Schema { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s19: Validate field and cross-field constraints in application code { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s20: Discard rejected Conversation; retry same setup identity in fresh context { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s21: Mark setup failed; keep session inactive { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s22: Persist immutable scenario in PostgreSQL; seed RedisJSON active profile · projection · Conversation binding; return learner-safe values { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s23: Create one OpenAI Conversation before full-profile generation { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s24: Return validated profile and Conversation ID together to setup coordinator after prompt { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s25: Mark server setup ready; pin model · mode · policy versions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s26: Derive the five setup variables from the validated full profile in application code { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i09: Allocate opaque per-visit ppid; bind it to authenticated sid { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i10: Create Redis JSON session mapping and initializing patient-profile receptacle { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i11: Confirm client preflight and Redis reservation before setup-generation command { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i12: Resolve the same server-held Conversation ID from sid + ppid for every later turn { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i13: Return client-safe four-value profile sans diagnosis, if any, after Redis commit { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i14: Select portrait folder from derived age band/body type and preload selected assets { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
i15: Show amber while required work is pending; show green and enable Enter Room only when ready { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
s01 -> s02 -> s03
