s03 -> s05: new setup
s05 -> s06
s06 -> s07: saturated / timed out
s06 -> s08: capacity available
s08 -> i09 -> i10 -> i11 -> s23 -> s09 -> s10 -> s11 -> s12 -> s13 -> s14 -> s15 -> s16 -> s17 -> s18
s19 -> s24: coherent case
s24 -> s26 -> s22 -> s25 -> i13 -> i14 -> i15
s24 -> i12
s18 -> s19: valid shape
s18 -> s20: invalid; retry allowed
s18 -> s21: retries exhausted
s19 -> s20: inconsistent; retry allowed
s19 -> s21: retries exhausted
s20 -> s23: discard invalid Conversation; create fresh retry context
